  "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 71,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Suddenly, you're paralyzed! You can barely breathe! Order of Tetrarch, Mask of Guardian! Perished Elves of Light!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 71,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The tablet is still and dark. Have a talk with Kastian here.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 71,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You feel a presence as you approach the tablet. There's a disturbance going on somewhere. Best not to get involved. Wait and see what happens.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 71,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. It seems that I heard someone laughing. The man said. \"One more hero you wanted is born here again.\" A lady with blue clothes answered. \"No, he is just a baby who starts toddling. But, he won't be only under h…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 75,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: A warrior with a tattoo of the Hestui tribe is fighting relics of the era of giants! His passionate bravery is a fiercely blazing flame, inextinguishable!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 75,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The tablet is still and dark. Hestui Warrior Shak Dun looks at the tablet and then at you.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
