  "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 85,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The Stone of Commune begins to vibrate. Suddenly, a powerful creature appears! Who is holding him back?",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 85,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The tablet is useless without a Stone of Commune. Find the man who protected you from the creature.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 85,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: There's a disturbance nearby. Don't get involved. Wait and see what happens.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 85,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: This time, the knowledge flows into your head painlessly! You've learned the power not permitted to us and the subsequent destiny. It seems you realized something big. Go to High Priest Hollint in Oren Castle Town , and report the progress.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 89,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: A vision appears of two men... The man being pursued has the Stone of Commune.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 89,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Listen to Feyshar first.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 89,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone nearby has the Stone of Commune, but it's too noisy right now. Wait until it quiets down.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 89,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Thoughts beyond understanding race through your mind. Laughter floats on the breeze... A man announces the birth of another Hero. The woman in blue disagrees... This is the last time she'll see the child! Communion with the six Tablets of Vision is complete. Return to Grand Magist…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 91,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: As you are about to lay your hands on the tablet, you can feel something behind you. And a new creature that you haven't seen before appears...",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 91,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You need the Stone of Commune to decipher the hieroglyphs on the tablet. Speak with Sparky the Cat about the Stone of Commune.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 91,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone is already communing with the Tablet of Vision. Please try again later.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 91,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: As you hold the Stone of Commune and concentrate on it, the tablet gets surrounded by bright light. You hear several hundred people simultaneously reading scriptures, and new knowledge starts to enter your mind. On one hand, you feel like you understand everything. On the other ha…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 98,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The Stone of Commune begins to vibrate. A strong adversary appears, but is restrained by someone.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 98,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Without a Stone of Commune it's just a tablet. Find the person who protected you.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 98,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: There's a disturbance nearby. Don't get involved. Wait and see what happens.",
